  "content": {
    "id": "p7-q13",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "These expressions are equivalent. By expanding and comparing coefficients, find the values of the pronumerals.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p7-q13-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$(a-b)x^2+(2a+b)x=7x-x^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=2,\\ b=3$.",
          "worked": "Comparing coefficients gives $a-b=-1$ and $2a+b=7$. Adding these equations:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}3a&=6\\\\a&=2\\end{align*}$$\n\nSubstituting into $a-b=-1$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2-b&=-1\\\\b&=3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q13-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$a(x-1)^2+b(x-1)+c=x^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=1,\\ b=2,\\ c=1$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a(x-1)^2+b(x-1)+c&=x^2\\\\a(x^2-2x+1)+bx-b+c&=x^2\\\\ax^2+(-2a+b)x+a-b+c&=x^2\\end{align*}$$\n\nComparing coefficients:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a&=1\\\\-2a+b&=0\\\\-2+b&=0\\\\b&=2\\\\a-b+c&=0\\\\1-2+c&=0\\\\c&=1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      }
    ]
  },
